  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "MiaAI-Lab native TensorFold at db28187 on two Sparks, with the creator's pinned nvfp4 checkpoint. Sixteen concurrent streams share the engine's dynamic FP8 KV pool; 1,048,576-token window with YaRN factor four, MTP depth fifteen, RoCE all-gather, image/video helper on rank zero. FP8 KV is lossy; draft verification does not imply equivalence to BF16 KV. Memory peak is an estimate for one full-window request based on the kit's model, cache and prefill accounting; additional streams remain subject to engine admission. Physical execution is unmeasured here.",
    "tags": [
      "qwen3.8",
      "tensorfold",
      "mtp",
      "vision",
      "video",
      "spark",
      "fp8-kv"
    ],
    "title": "Qwen3.8 Flash Next NVFP4 TensorFold dual Spark (Mia)"
